  "name": "Bird in Hand Receipt",
  "description": "This receipt is issued by Bird in Hand – Downtown Mexico and documents a food purchase processed through the Square point-of-sale system. The receipt includes a single menu item (Torta de Carnitas Ahogadas), followed by a financial summary showing the subtotal, multiple local sales tax components, the final transaction total, cash tendered, and change due. The footer records the transaction timestamp, indicates that the payment was processed via Square, provides a receipt number, and offers options to receive a text or email receipt or add comments. The overall layout is representative of a United States restaurant POS receipt using the Square payment platform, combining itemized sales reporting, multi-jurisdiction tax calculation, payment reconciliation, and digital receipt options.",
